    "https://rmu.edu/academics/schools/sems/actuarial-day": {
      "title": "Actuarial Science Career Day",
      "description": "Actuarial Science Career Day | Robert Morris University Skip to main content Top Header - Left Students Faculty / Staff Careers Career Center Top Header - Right Request Info Visit Make a Gift APPLY NOW Search the RMU Website You must have JavaScript enabled to use this form. Search Main navigation Why Choose RMU? WHY CHOOSE RMU? Reputation and Outcomes RMU is Affordable Campus Experience Pittsburgh: Thriving City Personal Attention Flexible Learning Athletic Tradition Admissions ADMISSIONS Freshman Admissions Graduate & Doctoral Admissions Transfer Admissions International Admissions Part-time, Readmission and Guest Students Veterans & Military Families Student Financial Services Financial Aid Office College Affordability Academy Academics ACADEMICS Undergraduate Programs Graduate Programs Doctoral Programs Certificate Programs Online Programs Schools & Departments Office of the Provost Special Academic Programs Research & Grants Administration Academic Calendar Elaine Boyd Library Alumni & Giving ALUMNI & GIVING Alumni Association Alumni Events Giving Options Update Your Information Athletics ATHLETICS RMUColonials.com UPMC Events Center Island Sports Center Club Sports Historic Highlights Support Colonials About RMU ABOUT RMU Office of the President Professional Development and Education Board of Trustees Center for Cyber Research and Training Mission, Vision, and Values University History Newsroom Events RMU Center for Veterans and Military Families Campus Police Collaborative Learning Institute Bayer Center for Nonprofit Management Academic Media Center Covestro Center for Community Engagement Menu GIVE | VISIT | GET INFO | APPLY Actuarial Science Career Day Career Day Information Event Date : Friday, September 25, 2026 Location: UPMC Events Center 6001 University Boulevard Moon Township, PA 15108 UPMC Gate, Conference Level Flyer Career Day provides an opportunity for students interested in actuarial careers to interact exclusively with actuarial employers, both local and national. RMU is hosting this event for the benefit of its 100+ RMU actuarial science majors, as well as non-RMU students from around the region. All registered students are welcome to submit their resumes by email in advance of the Actuarial Career Day. A complete resume packet will be sent to employers beforehand so that employers can set up in-person interviews. Details and Registration RMU Students | Free Students can register free by using the Handshake app or visiting rmu.joinhandshake.com Instructions and Resume Guidelines Email resumes to math04@rmu.edu by September 7th. Non-RMU Students | $40 Students can register here . Instructions and Resume Guidelines Email resumes to math04@rmu.edu by September 7th. Employers | $200 Companies must sign-up for Handshake and register through the free app. Donations Interested in giving to the Actuarial Science Fund ? The following companies participated in 2025: Acrisure Aetna, a CVS Health Company Allianz Life Insurance Company of North America Cigna Group Constellation Insurance Elevance Health Erie Insurance Florida Blue (Blue Cross and Blue Shield of Florida) Gallagher Highmark Health Mercer Metro Benefits, Inc. New York Life Oliver Wyman Actuarial Principal Financial Group UPMC Insurance Division Services WTW Have Questions? Please contact Jacquelyn Griffin at griffinj@rmu.edu with any questions or for assistance. Nav - Academics ACADEMICS Undergraduate Programs Graduate Programs Doctoral Programs Certificate Programs Online Programs Schools & Departments Rockwell School of Business School of Communication and Media School of Data Intelligence and Technology School of Education and Social Sciences School of Engineering and Science Actuarial Career Day Degrees & Majors Department of Engineering Department of Science Faculty News SEMS Board of Visitors School of Health Professions Office of the Provost Special Academic Programs Research & Grants Administration Academic Calendar Elaine